<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 15.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 15.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Apr 99.00 Jul 106.00/05.50</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire, Oxfordshire Oct/Dec 101.50 Jan/Mar 104.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 100.00/99.50</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr 100.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to West Norfolk Apr 95.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Apr 97.00/96.50</p>
<p>No business was reported for milling wheat.</p>
</text>
